<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="profile-overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="profile-container" class="card" style="width: 90%; max-width: 500px; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(15, 10, 30, 0.85); border-width: 2px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 32px; padding: 40px;">
            <ui:Label name="profile-title" text="HỒ SƠ" style="font-size: 34px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 25px; letter-spacing: 1px;" />

            <!-- Avatar Selection -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="profile-avatar-container" style="width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 70px; border-width: 4px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); justify-content: center; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; overflow: hidden;">
                <ui:VisualElement name="profile-avatar" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; justify-content: center; align-items: center;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <ui:TextField name="profile-name-field" label="Tên hiển thị" style="font-size: 22px; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 25px; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 6px 12px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); color: white;" />

            <ui:Button name="profile-save-btn" text="LƯU" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; font-size: 28px; height: 65px; border-radius: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;" />
            <ui:Button name="profile-close-btn" text="ĐÓNG" class="btn btn-cancel" style="width: 100%; font-size: 22px; height: 55px; border-radius: 16px;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
